    <textAnnotation id="sid-FFB8BED3-47D4-4AFD-BC20-BBC454A22CA0" signavio:alignment="left">
      <extensionElements>
        <signavio:signavioMetaData metaKey="bordercolor" metaValue="#000000" />
      </extensionElements>
      <text>extend maternity/paternity leave</text>
    </textAnnotation>
    <textAnnotation id="sid-7B375644-3DD0-4858-A2E2-D9456AEB7854" signavio:alignment="left">
      <extensionElements>
        <signavio:signavioMetaData metaKey="bordercolor" metaValue="#000000" />
      </extensionElements>
      <text>no application for financial support</text>
    </textAnnotation>
    <textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_18avzsp">
      <text>Title: Becoming A Parent

Create a process that support in planning, taking and extending a maternity leave.  
* Fetch information about potential models (months duration, split between parents) 
* Let parent select 
* Collect relevant information 
* Notify Social Security, Company in time 
* Gather information from companies 
* At the end of the period let parent decide about extension.</text>
    </textAnnotation>
  </process>
